Description: antinomie: record task credentials and hash executed and deleted files
Author: MikiMiku <jonathanirvinjo@gmail.com>
Origin: project
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-20

Record traced task credentials (revision 17) and deferred SHA-256 of executed and deleted files, with bounded queue and size budget.

---
